learnings:
  - paradigm-mcp does NOT depend on @a-company/paradigm — cross-package imports for shared utilities require either workspace-style imports (added complexity) or duplication. For small, stable schema (authority.yaml ~30 lines of I/O), duplication is the right call.
  - vitest test timeout default is 5s — doesn't inherit from execSync timeouts. When build duration grows past 5s, the integration-build test needs explicit per-test timeout (3rd arg to it()).
  - Mid-stream agent termination is recoverable when partial state is on disk + the spec is detailed enough — main session can finish without re-firing the agent. v6.0.4 Wave 3+4 had the same recovery pattern.
